{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Harmony 本身用于跨单细胞数据集构建联合嵌入以解决批次整合，但该证据不涉及 Seurat 5.3.0 中 IntegrateLayers 或 JoinLayers 的层状态。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Here we introduce Harmony, an algorithm for robust, scalable, and flexible multi-dataset integration to meet four key challenges of unsupervised scRNAseq joint embedding"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Harmony 的输入契约要求每个细胞有协变量标签，且 Seurat 对象需预先计算好细胞嵌入槽位；这提示应先核对 IntegrateLayers 调用前的对象状态，而不是直接归因于 JoinLayers。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Harmony accepts a matrix of cells and covariate labels for each cell as input."
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "@param object the Seurat object. It needs to have the appropriate slot of cell embeddings precomputed."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "group.by.vars 参数指定 Harmony 要移除效应的协变量；若该参数与 IntegrateLayers 的批次变量不一致，可能影响整合结果，但现有证据不能证明它会导致 RNA assay 零层。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "@param group.by.vars the name(s) of covariates that harmony will remove its effect on the data."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Harmony 从低维嵌入开始，PCA 只是示例而非唯一必需方法；因此需要确认 IntegrateLayers 实际使用了哪个 reduction，而不是默认假设 PCA。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "Harmony, described in detail in Supplementary Note 1, begins with a low dimensional embedding of cells, such as Principal Components Analysis (PCA)"
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "当前观察状态是 RNA assay 报告零层，且操作序列为 IntegrateLayers(HarmonyIntegration) 后 JoinLayers；这属于用户提供的运行时事实，不能据此推断根因。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:observed_state",
        "user:operation_sequence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "检查结果：当前数据状态为未绑定、未注册输入、无可测量数据，因此无法执行任何修复或验证。",
      "basis": "OBSERVED_STATE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "observed:status",
        "observed:input_registered",
        "observed:measurements_available"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "提醒：Harmony 的校正嵌入输出在 Seurat/SCE 访问器行为方面缺乏固定 OperatorRevision 证据，不能推断 RNA 计数校正或一般 API 兼容性；这不代表零层现象的原因。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 6,
          "quote": "SingleCellExperiment object. After running RunHarmony, the corrected cell embeddings can be accessed with reducedDim(object, \"Harmony\")."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "建议的只读 triage 顺序：先检查 IntegrateLayers 调用前的 assay 层清单和 reduction 名称，再检查 JoinLayers 的参数与返回对象，最后核对 group.by.vars 与批次元数据是否一致；这些步骤不涉及修复。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "请提供 IntegrateLayers 调用前 RNA assay 的层清单（例如 Layers(object[['RNA']]) 的输出）以及 JoinLayers 使用的具体参数。",
    "missing_field": "pre_integration_layer_inventory",
    "why_needed": "只有知道整合前的层状态和 JoinLayers 参数，才能判断零层是发生在整合阶段还是合并阶段，从而给出有针对性的 triage 顺序。"
  }
}
